message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the archived release and the associated paper."
title: "Reproducibility Artifact for Auditable Policy-Governed LLM-Agent Control for O-RAN Edge Security"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Frozen reproducibility artifact containing the synthetic-policy oracle,
  external LangGraph and open-weights baselines, prompt-injection experiment,
  analysis scripts, hash manifests, and manuscript-support evidence.
  Version 1.2.0 also retains the recovered 180-run records and the new
  240-trial, 1080-call matched inference-block study, including failures.
